%% pipeline-overview-v1.mmd
flowchart LR
    classDef stage fill:#f5f5ff,stroke:#445,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111;
    classDef gate fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#b36b00,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111;
    classDef artifact fill:#ecf8ff,stroke:#2684ff,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111;

    Intake["Case Intake / Audio Upload"]:::stage
    Transcribe["Transcribe Pipeline"]:::stage
    Analyze["Analyze Pipeline"]:::stage
    Atoms["Atoms Index"]:::artifact
    Compose["Compose Pipeline"]:::stage
    Guardian["Guardian & QA Gates"]:::gate
    Deliver["Deliverables + Manifests"]:::artifact

    Intake -->|Audio file / Intake data| Transcribe
    Transcribe -->|`transcript.txt` + `transcript_v1.json`| Analyze
    Analyze -->|Canonical analysis artifacts| Compose
    Analyze -. feeds .-> Atoms
    Atoms -. citations .-> Compose
    Compose --> Guardian --> Deliver

    Guardian -. waiver / retry .-> Compose
    Analyze -. rerun lanes .-> Analyze
    Transcribe -. retry policy .-> Transcribe
